  "details": "1. Use any type of controller (for example, oculus touch).\n\n2. Turn on another type of controller (like the knuckles controllers)\n\nWhen switching from oculus controllers to index controllers, it will use the index controllers, but a white outline of those controllers will persist.\n\nAnd another side effect of doing so is that the one-handed display will start spazzing as well.\n\nHere are some other topics that have similar problems:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/switching-controllers\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/bug-outlines-of-vr-controllers-lingering-and-causing-tracking-issues",
